  "details": "Hello, I'm LeijinKZ, I'm mute person. I been playing VRchat with my lab top for about 2 week.\nI have a lot of fun playing in VRchat, I'm sure the player base also do.\nI like presentation room the most, I can use a pen to communicate with others.\n\nThere is a problem of playing VRchat for a week.\nI started to pump in some very good artist in VRchat's presentation room.\nThey are very talented and very strong.\nSome people gave them respect and just watch.\nSome people in the room clear their work, or they just not know that some one is working.\nSome people just went in the artist face and ruined their work by drawing on their work with another pen.\nI have seen their work being cleared or destroy over and over again.\nI try to tell them not to do so (with a pen, I have a lot of trouble with that), but they just don't give a single respect to the artist and me, and just ignored me.\nThey don't want to open a private room because they want to show their work to everyone.\nIt's not VRchat's fault, it's the people's fault.\n\nI think VRchat should do some thing to protect these talented artist.\n\nI think presentation room's clear button should not be available for all people in the room, preventing people clearing their work, the clear button should be only available for the owner of the room.\n\nI think VRchat should have another room type for these artist:\n1. Able to draw (pens and rubbers)\n2. Able to be seen by anyone\n3. Able to talk to the people are watching\n4. Only the person own the room can clear the room\n\nThank you for reading, have a good day, see you in the presentation room. ^^",
